#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:9
msgid "平台工程手册"
msgstr "Platform engineering handbook"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:11
msgid ""
"Nexus 只维护可复用的嵌入式机制。应用、任务、协议策略和私有 PCB 数据由外部工程维护。 生产代码采用 C11 "
"和必要的启动汇编；公共接口不暴露厂商类型。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus maintains reusable embedded mechanisms. Applications, tasks, protocol "
"policy and private PCB data belong in external projects. Production code "
"uses C11 and necessary startup assembly; public interfaces do not expose "
"vendor types."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:14
msgid "构建与配置"
msgstr "Build and configuration"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:16
msgid ""
"TOML schema 2 是装配输入，JSON 保存芯片和板级事实。集中式 Python 配置器验证资源， 生成不可变配置、静态实例和强类型 "
"factory。SoC、Board 和固件算法直接使用 C。 CMake target 是软件依赖的唯一权威。初始化不启动调度器，factory "
"查询不初始化硬件。"
msgstr ""
"TOML schema 2 is the assembly input; JSON records chip and board facts. The "
"centralized Python configuration tool validates resources and generates "
"immutable configuration, static instances and a strongly typed factory. SoC,"
" Board and firmware algorithms use C directly. CMake targets alone own "
"software dependencies. Initialization does not start a scheduler, and "
"factory lookup does not initialize hardware."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:20
msgid ""
"保留厂商仓库、精确 gitlink、来源锁和许可证。默认只准备和编译选中的 STM32F4 依赖。 其他系列留作库存，不进入默认测试、编译或 "
"SDK。生产范围以精确器件、板卡和模式为准。"
msgstr ""
"Preserve vendor repositories, exact gitlinks, source locks and licenses. "
"Default preparation and compilation select only the STM32F4 dependencies. "
"Other families remain inventory and do not enter default tests, builds or "
"SDKs. Production scope is defined by exact part, board and mode."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:23
msgid "测试保留规则"
msgstr "Test retention rules"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:25
msgid ""
"新增行为和缺陷修复先执行可复现的 RED，再实现 GREEN，随后重构。 C 合同使用 GoogleTest／GoogleMock，工具使用 "
"Python unittest。 模拟外部硬件和内核边界，直接执行真实平台实现。"
msgstr ""
"Execute a reproducible RED for new behavior and defect fixes, implement "
"GREEN, then refactor. C contracts use GoogleTest/GoogleMock; tools use "
"Python unittest. Mock external hardware and kernel boundaries while "
"executing the actual platform implementation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:29
msgid ""
"保留所有权、取消、超时、IRQ、DMA、停止失败、故障恢复、实例隔离和资源预算的回归。 纯 C "
"公共头、ABI、向量和链接检查也必须保留。不要只按测试数量或文件名删除用例。 共享算法的通用断言按实现类别执行；编译配置变体只补充各自差异的断言。"
msgstr ""
"Retain regressions for ownership, cancellation, timeout, IRQ, DMA, failed "
"stop, recovery, instance isolation and resource budgets. Keep pure C public-"
"header, ABI, vector and link checks. Never delete cases solely by count or "
"filename. Run common algorithm assertions per implementation class; compile-"
"time variants add assertions for their actual differences."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:33
msgid ""
"废弃功能应同时删除入口、实现、测试、构建配置、打包清单和文档。 等价重复断言只保留一处权威；有独立故障路径或编译上下文的测试不是重复。 "
"历史报告保存在固定 Git 提交，不在当前源码树重复保存归档、恢复包和任务台账。"
msgstr ""
"Retire an obsolete feature together with its entry points, implementation, "
"tests, build configuration, package lists and documentation. Keep one "
"authority for equivalent assertions; distinct failure paths and compiler "
"contexts are not duplicates. Historical reports remain at fixed Git commits "
"rather than duplicated archives, recovery bundles and task ledgers in the "
"current source tree."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:37
msgid "自动化入口"
msgstr "Automation entry points"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:39
msgid ""
"安装开发工具后启用标准 pre-commit 和 commit-msg hook。不得跳过 hook 或自动暂存修复。 "
"提交检查读取完整暂存区，执行格式、注释、文档、工作流和行为检查。 提交门禁只配置、构建一次，执行完整 Native CTest "
"和受影响的完整工具测试模块。 hook 与 Native CI 共享同一 CTest 计划，并逐例核对未过滤的 GoogleTest 发现和 XML "
"身份。 普通固件实现不触发整套辅助工具域；公共头和声明事实选择配置合同与一次全局支持检查。 "
"已修改的测试模块完整执行，已知工具实现按维护映射选择模块；未知路径或缺少已知覆盖 保守执行完整域。提交报告明确标记 `commit-tools` 和 "
"`qualification=false`，不冒充 整域通过，也不按用例名称过滤。文档仍检查配置示例和双语完整性。"
msgstr ""
"Install development tools and enable the standard pre-commit and commit-msg "
"hooks. Never bypass hooks or stage fixes automatically. Commit checks read "
"the complete staged index and check formatting, comments, documentation, "
"workflows and behavior. The commit gate configures and builds once, then "
"runs the complete Native CTest plan and complete affected tool-test modules."
" The hook and Native CI share one CTest plan and verify exact unfiltered "
"GoogleTest discovery and XML identities. Ordinary firmware implementation "
"changes do not trigger complete auxiliary tool domains. Public headers and "
"declarative facts select configuration contracts and one global support "
"check. Changed test modules run in full. Known tool implementations select "
"modules through maintained mappings. Unknown paths or missing known coverage"
" conservatively execute complete domains. Commit reports explicitly state "
"`commit-tools` and `qualification=false`. They do not claim full-domain "
"acceptance or filter cases by name. Documentation checks configuration "
"examples and bilingual completeness."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:47
msgid ""
"合并或交付前独立执行完整工具域、相关 ARM 链接和 Source SDK 消费者。 `--all` 与 `--tools all` 始终执行 "
"testing、configure、ci 三个常规工具域。 快速提交不能替代这些验收。 权威范围选择在 "
"`tools/testing/run_tool_tests.py`，不能临时绕过或复用成功报告。"
msgstr ""
"Before merge or delivery, independently execute complete tool domains, "
"relevant ARM links and Source SDK consumers. `--all` and `--tools all` "
"always run the three regular domains, testing, configure and ci. Quick "
"commits do not replace these acceptance checks. "
"`tools/testing/run_tool_tests.py` owns authoritative scope selection. Do not"
" bypass it ad hoc or reuse successful reports."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:56
msgid ""
"两条命令共用完整 Native 和三个常规工具域，`check` 先执行整仓风格检查。 完整 CI 在三个常规工具域之外分别执行 integration 和 "
"freertos，文档 job 执行文档用例 和严格双语构建。工作流合同由 ci 域维护。Native 矩阵分别执行 native-"
"debug、native-release、native-asan、native-tsan 的完整 CTest 计划。 Native "
"模式不重复执行与模式无关的工具测试。ARM 和迁移后的 SDK 消费者验证独立执行。"
msgstr ""
"Both commands run the complete Native suite and the three regular tool "
"domains. `check` first checks style across the repository. Beyond"
" the three regular tool domains, complete CI separately executes integration"
" and freertos. The documentation job runs documentation tests and the strict"
" bilingual build. The ci domain owns workflow contracts. The Native matrix "
"executes complete CTest plans for native-debug, native-release, native-asan "
"and native-tsan. Native modes do not repeat mode-independent tool tests. ARM"
" and relocated SDK consumer validation execute separately."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:61
msgid ""
"`doctor` 只诊断所选工具和环境，不扫描全部装配、不生成维护报告。普通 configure／build "
"只保留必要日志和真实返回码；设备操作需要精确映像身份时显式传入 `--record-provenance`。 全局能力与派生文档一致性由 testing"
" 域集中检查一次，局部外设测试不再扫描整个平台。 格式、实际行为和资源边界必须保留，不为维持工具数量保留无用报告或重复包装。"
msgstr ""
"`doctor` only diagnoses selected tools and the environment; it neither scans"
" every assembly nor generates maintenance reports. Ordinary configure/build "
"commands retain necessary logs and actual exit codes. Explicitly pass "
"`--record-provenance` when preparing an exact image identity for device "
"operations. The testing domain checks global capability and derived-document"
" consistency once; local peripheral tests no longer scan the whole platform."
" Preserve formatting, actual behavior and resource boundaries instead of "
"retaining useless reports or duplicate wrappers merely to maintain the tool "
"count."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:66
msgid "输出必须新鲜、非空，保留实际返回码。缺失工具、跳过用例和旧报告不能建立通过状态。 最多使用分配的并发预算，避免多个构建同时占满内存。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs must be fresh and nonempty, with actual exit codes. Missing tools, "
"skipped cases and old reports cannot establish a pass. Stay within the "
"assigned concurrency budget and avoid simultaneous builds that exhaust "
"memory."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:69
msgid ""
"`dev.py configure` 只配置当前平台源码根，拒绝指向其他工程的 `-S`。外部产品使用 其显式 CMake "
"命令，保持产品源码和平台托管构建的责任分开。"
msgstr ""
"`dev.py configure` configures only the current platform source root and "
"rejects `-S` pointing to another project. External products use their "
"explicit CMake commands, keeping product-source and platform-managed build "
"responsibilities separate."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:72
msgid "并行构建的目录所有权"
msgstr "Directory ownership for parallel builds"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:74
msgid ""
"托管 configure／build／test／check、TDD、Native runtime 和 matrix 共用每个规范 "
"构建目录的内核锁，直到所有阶段和报告发布完成。同目录的独立托管执行立即拒绝，不同目录 可以并行；日志独立不替代构建目录互斥。"
msgstr ""
"Managed configure/build/test/check, TDD, Native runtime and matrix entries "
"share one kernel lock per canonical build directory until every stage and "
"report publication completes. An independent managed execution in that "
"directory rejects immediately; separate directories can run in parallel. "
"Independent logs do not replace build-directory exclusion."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:78
msgid ""
"POSIX 嵌套命令通过真实文件描述符继承并核对目录与文件身份；同线程组合可重入， "
"其他线程不自动继承。异常或取消完成所属进程排空后，关闭最后一个描述符才释放锁。 Windows 独立命令使用文件锁，嵌套托管执行明确要求 "
"POSIX，不据此声明 Windows 矩阵通过。继承描述符表示同一编排内的委托；父编排必须串行执行同目录子阶段， "
"共享同一委托描述符的子进程之间不自动互斥。直接 CMake／Ninja／CTest 不参与该协议， 调用者必须保证目录独占。"
msgstr ""
"POSIX nested commands inherit real file descriptors and verify directory and"
" file identity. Same-thread composition is reentrant; other threads do not "
"inherit ownership automatically. After exceptions or cancellation drain "
"owned processes, the last descriptor closes to release the lock. Windows "
"standalone commands use file locks; nested managed execution explicitly "
"requires POSIX, without claiming a Windows matrix pass. Descriptor "
"inheritance delegates ownership within one orchestration. The parent must "
"serialize child stages using the same directory; children sharing one "
"delegated descriptor are not mutually exclusive. Direct CMake/Ninja/CTest do"
" not participate; callers must keep the directory exclusive."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:85
msgid "代码与审查"
msgstr "Code and review"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:87
msgid ""
"沿用 .clang-format、.editorconfig 和反斜杠 Doxygen 风格：80 列、四空格、同行花括号。 "
"注释说明约束、所有权和硬件顺序，避免逐行复述代码。禁止重新设定历史风格债务基线。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the existing .clang-format, .editorconfig and backslash Doxygen style: "
"80 columns, four spaces and attached braces. Comments explain constraints, "
"ownership and hardware ordering rather than restating code line by line. "
"Never rebaseline historical style debt."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:90
msgid ""
"优先复用经审核的官方 HAL／LL，厂商 handle 留在实现内部。一个控制器只有一个硬件 owner。 借用一直保留到最终 "
"SETTLED；取消和排空失败不能提前回收缓冲。应用拥有调度和恢复策略。 中断、生命周期、存储和并发改动须独立审查。普通重构的验证成本应与实际风险相称。"
msgstr ""
"Prefer reviewed official HAL/LL implementations and keep vendor handles "
"private. A controller has one hardware owner. Borrows remain live until "
"final SETTLED; cancellation or failed drain cannot reclaim buffers early. "
"Applications own scheduling and recovery policy. Interrupt, lifecycle, "
"storage and concurrency changes need independent review. Validation costs "
"for ordinary refactoring should match the actual risk."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:94
msgid "交付边界"
msgstr "Delivery boundaries"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/engineering.md:96
msgid ""
"Native 验证软件模型，ARM ELF 验证编译、链接和资源，Source SDK 验证独立消费。 "
"它们不能替代真实板卡上的时钟、延迟、吞吐、功耗和故障测量。物理 HIL 保持 not_executed。 PR "
"记录当前变更、真实验证结果和剩余限制，不维护重复的候选发布或任务台账系统。"
msgstr ""
"Native validates software models, ARM ELF validates compilation, linking and"
" resources, and Source SDK validates independent consumption. These do not "
"replace real-board measurements of clocks, latency, throughput, power and "
"faults. Physical HIL remains not_executed. PRs record changes, actual "
"validation and remaining limits without a duplicate candidate-promotion or "
"task-ledger system."
